            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naye Ruthu Mmoabi akamwambia Naomi, Niruhusu niende shambani, niokote mabaki ya masuke nyuma yake yule ambaye nitaona kibali machoni pake. Akamwambia, Haya, mwanangu, nenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi akaenda, akaja akaokota mabaki shambani nyuma ya wavunaji; na kwa bahati akafikia sehemu ya shamba la Boazi, ambaye alikuwa wa jamaa yake Elimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
