          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Boazi akamwambia Ruthu, Mwanangu, sikiliza; wewe usiende kuokota masazo katika shamba lingine, wala usiondoke hapa, lakini ukae papa hapa karibu na wasichana wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Macho yako na yaelekee shamba walivunalo, ufuatane nao; je! Sikuwaagiza vijana wasikusumbue? Tena, ukiona kiu, uende kwenye vyombo, nawe uyanywe waliyoyateka hao vijana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:10"
